//   - `h = apply_motion_mid(h);` after the middle_block resblock/attention (inside `if (!tiny_unet)`).
//   - `h = apply_motion_output(output_block_idx, h);` after the output-block attention_layer_forward.
// (C) unet.hpp MUST #include "model/diffusion/animatediff.hpp" at the top (upstream line 9).

